%% status: current (solid = implemented, dashed = proposed)
%% title: Settlement preparation and signing, owner-run local path
sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Owner in browser
  participant T as Local console tools
  participant F as Freighter
  participant N as Soroban RPC
  T->>N: read current chain state
  T->>T: build step from approved batch, cap 1 base unit
  T->>N: simulate step
  T->>O: show step and ask for typed confirmation
  O->>T: I CONFIRM SUBMIT STEP n
  T->>F: signAuthEntry, valid at most 10 ledgers by policy
  F-->>T: signed entry
  T->>F: signTransaction for the envelope
  F-->>T: signed envelope
  T->>N: re-simulate, then send once
  Note over T: Tobin servers hold no private key and never retry automatically
